ENCRYPTION BY PASSWORD = 'password';

As this requires a password, take care to ensure it is not exposed to unauthorized persons or stored as plain text."
  reference   : "800-171|3.13.16,800-171r3|03.13.08,800-53|SC-28,800-53r5|SC-28,CAT|I,CCI|CCI-001199,CN-L3|8.1.4.7(b),CN-L3|8.1.4.8(b),CSF|PR.DS-1,CSF2.0|PR.DS-01,GDPR|32.1.a,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(iv),HIPAA|164.312(e)(2)(ii),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.10,ISO-27001-2022|A.5.33,ITSG-33|SC-28,ITSG-33|SC-28a.,LEVEL|1M,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|3.4,PCI-DSSv4.0|3.3.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|3.5.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|6.2,Rule-ID|SV-271322r1108582_rule,STIG-ID|SQLI-22-009700,Vuln-ID|V-271322"
